    <string name="onboarding_title_1">One tap a day</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_1">Habit Companion makes daily tracking simple. Tap the ring for binary habits, or enter an amount for quantity habits.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_title_2">Watch the chain grow</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_2">Completed scheduled occurrences extend a streak. Quantity habits count when the target is reached; Weekly habits count required quota completions. Keep the chain in view.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_title_3">A Coach that reads the pattern</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_3">The Coach uses a limited pattern summary to suggest a plan. Habits are stored on this device; using the Coach sends the permitted context and your questions to an AI service.</string>

